# Tiffin menu Pune: what's in your tiffin today

4 rotis, one dry sabzi, one dal or curry, rice. Sweet on Sundays. Menu changes daily and is posted on WhatsApp at 9 pm.

Cold-pressed groundnut oil, no ajinomoto. Jain meals at same price.

**[Start a weekly plan](https://wa.me/919876543210)**

## Every tiffin includes

- **4 fresh rotis**: Made fresh each morning
- **One dry sabzi**: Seasonal vegetables, cooked simply
- **One dal or curry**: Rotates daily — moong, toor, chana, rajma, kadhi
- **Steamed rice**: Plain or jeera rice depending on the day
- **Sweet on Sundays**: A small traditional sweet to end the week

## Jain meals available

We offer Jain meals (no onion, no garlic) at the same price. Just let us know when you order.

## How the menu works

The menu changes every day. We post tomorrow's menu on WhatsApp at 9 pm. You will always know what is coming.

See our [weekly and monthly plans](/plans) or read [our story](/about).

## Common questions about the menu

### Can I choose what goes in my tiffin?

The menu is set daily by our kitchen. We do not offer customisation, but the variety rotates through the week.

### Is the food spicy?

It is home-style — mildly spiced. If you need it milder, tell us on WhatsApp and we will note it.

### What if I have allergies?

We use groundnut oil and dairy. We do not use ajinomoto. For specific allergies, message us before ordering.

## Want this tiffin tomorrow?

Message us on WhatsApp to start your weekly plan.

