## What both plans include

- **Daily delivery 12 to 1 pm**: Monday to Saturday, to Baner, Aundh, Balewadi, Pashan
- **Menu on WhatsApp at 9 pm**: Know tomorrow's lunch the night before
- **Jain option at same price**: No onion, no garlic — just tell us when ordering
- **Pause anytime free**: One day notice, no charge for paused days

## Weekly plan — Rs 780

6 lunches, Monday to Saturday. Best if you want to try us first or have a changing schedule.

## Monthly plan — Rs 3,200

26 lunches across the month. Best if you are settled and want the lowest per-meal cost.

## To start a plan

1. **Message us on WhatsApp**: Share your address and pick weekly or monthly
1. **Pay by UPI**: We send a UPI link. Pay at the start of the plan.
1. **Lunch starts next weekday**: Order cutoff is 8 pm for next-day delivery

## Plan questions

### What if I am on leave?

Pause your plan with one day notice. No charge for paused days. Resume when you are back.

### Can I switch from weekly to monthly?

Yes. Message us and we will adjust your next payment.

### Do you deliver on Sundays?

No. We deliver Monday to Saturday. Sunday is our kitchen rest day.

### What if lunch is late?

We aim for 12 to 1 pm. If there is a delay, we message you. It rarely happens.

## Start your plan this week

Message us on WhatsApp and we will get you set up.

